  "technical": {
    "status": "PASS",
    "outcomes": [
      "Four widths (320/390/900/1440), 200% text and Russian: required roles reachable, visible, named and unclipped; no horizontal overflow.",
      "Opacity, clipping and overlap mutations rejected; Settings/Edit rules duplicate rejected through a shared real handler; distinct players and justified repeated entries preserved.",
      "All four titles bind their own holder/next/queue/durations/action; keyboard tabs and bounded long-queue scrolling work; IDs and command aliases remain.",
      "Settings cancel, validation, title scope, global/per-title durations, confirmation/cancel, advance, release and per-player removal passed.",
      "VIP lookup/add/remove and blocked ID validation/add/remove, Escape and modal focus passed.",
      "All four local mutation failures preserve data, report recovery, reject repeated submit and allow retry.",
      "Empty/loading/error/retry/view-only states and narrow English/Russian dialogs passed."
    ]
  },
